    {
      "id": "u_94767684b5ef67ab62ac14a6_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Starting with v0.103.0, Trilium has a custom media player for both video and audio files, which offers more features than the built-in player.",
      "sourceHash": "94767684b5ef67ab62ac14a6fbea96997cd3ea9c4f48545162e5d95ffb8f11f4",
      "context": "Audio & Video",
      "contextHash": "8071e3516df00f17e9ebf7e129d0a57df7a0138fee38ec564faa72a7a1e79aed",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_043a88c549db885c1c55ab48_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Versions prior to v0.103.0 also support media, but using the built-in player.",
      "sourceHash": "043a88c549db885c1c55ab48162beb37ab1898279d6942da8dcc4ce0a2a02120",
      "context": "Audio & Video",
      "contextHash": "8071e3516df00f17e9ebf7e129d0a57df7a0138fee38ec564faa72a7a1e79aed",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_77096bb9873a862bb003c024_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The file is streamed directly, so when accessing the note from a server it doesn't have to download the entire file to start playing it.",
      "sourceHash": "77096bb9873a862bb003c0249c2c1495e8232374e272b389d056d91a3e82ea65",
      "context": "Audio & Video",
      "contextHash": "8071e3516df00f17e9ebf7e129d0a57df7a0138fee38ec564faa72a7a1e79aed",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_8b2b543cebe755c80bc0ed57_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Note on large media files__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "8b2b543cebe755c80bc0ed5769c53ca06fd53731cabc4b9beef312f4e089cf23",
      "context": "Audio & Video > Note on large media files",
      "contextHash": "78d1f3a046e39d400f79b37a5baeb4cdd99a5a193570784b823983ba3b9d4c47",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_79b5ffed123590d04e760fd7_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Although Trilium offers support for media files, it is generally not meant to be used with very large files. Uploading large media will cause the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Database__TRILIUM_PH_1__ to balloon, as well as any __TRILIUM_PH_2__Backup__TRILIUM_PH_3__ of it. In addition, there might be slowdowns when first uploading the files. Otherwise, a large database should not impact the general performance of Trilium significantly.",
      "sourceHash": "79b5ffed123590d04e760fd7a99985240c86b5ad4ae02a91c854e617902282ba",
      "context": "Audio & Video > Note on large media files",
      "contextHash": "78d1f3a046e39d400f79b37a5baeb4cdd99a5a193570784b823983ba3b9d4c47",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_9ee7bb727750e0d4cf9b9378_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Supported formats__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "9ee7bb727750e0d4cf9b9378d59ea667bc705f767f3616102853ff696b602e7a",
      "context": "Audio & Video > Supported formats",
      "contextHash": "7ba79e4d4bccad765934bc82fe0e2eb9d46f115bde861ed7a79fd60db0c6d0ae",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_03c6778b4910f46c3838f063_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Trilium uses the built-in media decoding mechanism of the browser (or Electron/Chromium when running on the desktop). Starting with v0.103.0, a message will be displayed instead when a media format is not supported.",
      "sourceHash": "03c6778b4910f46c3838f06302758ee719a466ae9530016acf6f76aeecb8e11e",
      "context": "Audio & Video > Supported formats",
      "contextHash": "7ba79e4d4bccad765934bc82fe0e2eb9d46f115bde861ed7a79fd60db0c6d0ae",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_9d268b81055b115f134b54e2_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Interactions__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "9d268b81055b115f134b54e27711efe7d1c1fdc2f230b69737d2e8384171effc",
      "context": "Audio & Video > Interactions",
