      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_551a2ec53d6b555d85640a08_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "To play/pause, simply click anywhere on the media. For video files, the controls at the bottom will hide automatically after playing, simply move the mouse to show them again.",
      "sourceHash": "551a2ec53d6b555d85640a087953bf4a42dc5b0a7afadde73d732f5d9ad3d0af",
      "context": "Audio & Video > Interactions",
      "contextHash": "1ae63872b0f12c9e571837f1fe71fe052fbb31714472811f143e7f88d38ba5f3",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_ed7dcf01c9efe8fa2f958a7b_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The bottom bar has the following features:",
      "sourceHash": "ed7dcf01c9efe8fa2f958a7b5c4020bf12e46426a78f0b4303beb6573daac1e4",
      "context": "Audio & Video > Interactions",
      "contextHash": "1ae63872b0f12c9e571837f1fe71fe052fbb31714472811f143e7f88d38ba5f3",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_81a7ad3bbd80b2fbbbbde54d_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "A track bar to seek across the media. Audio files up to 60 MB will display a waveform seekbar, to give a visual overview of the track's structure: silences, pauses, and louder segments.",
      "sourceHash": "81a7ad3bbd80b2fbbbbde54d1d91053d71eba865e0ca90a1993e96ed7bb4d8bc",
      "context": "Audio & Video > Interactions",
      "contextHash": "1ae63872b0f12c9e571837f1fe71fe052fbb31714472811f143e7f88d38ba5f3",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_6f5668957766ce49bfd15c4c_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "On the left of the track bar, the current time is indicated.",
      "sourceHash": "6f5668957766ce49bfd15c4ca140ccf5094dc4b2e04a291edd8956d538f3b440",
      "context": "Audio & Video > Interactions",
      "contextHash": "1ae63872b0f12c9e571837f1fe71fe052fbb31714472811f143e7f88d38ba5f3",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_6a5ba1d1cb46ae609ae4c1e0_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "On the right of the track bar, the remaining time is indicated.",
      "sourceHash": "6a5ba1d1cb46ae609ae4c1e083a58f307a3e66790dec3511dd73595a011d1671",
      "context": "Audio & Video > Interactions",
      "contextHash": "1ae63872b0f12c9e571837f1fe71fe052fbb31714472811f143e7f88d38ba5f3",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_6fb630e14d6ec25b7cd35cd7_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "On the left side there are buttons to:",
      "sourceHash": "6fb630e14d6ec25b7cd35cd7d608f3e05840541019853d04b9110d43ed8be3d3",
      "context": "Audio & Video > Interactions",
      "contextHash": "1ae63872b0f12c9e571837f1fe71fe052fbb31714472811f143e7f88d38ba5f3",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_be8074fb22633a33cd47054f_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Adjust the playback speed (e.g. 0.5x, 1x).",
      "sourceHash": "be8074fb22633a33cd47054fb04a43667a3797bb651c083b5a44d5d11bd4e10b",
      "context": "Audio & Video > Interactions",
      "contextHash": "1ae63872b0f12c9e571837f1fe71fe052fbb31714472811f143e7f88d38ba5f3",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_5a1a0be1ca15b3668608d614_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Play mode (applies to all media from the parent note):",
      "sourceHash": "5a1a0be1ca15b3668608d614ea3d8271bcfbb54f84c32c671a6d9f52a7c59c57",
      "context": "Audio & Video > Interactions",
      "contextHash": "1ae63872b0f12c9e571837f1fe71fe052fbb31714472811f143e7f88d38ba5f3",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_96e991a9b79619d3f26608a2_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Play once — play the media until it ends, then stop.",
      "sourceHash": "96e991a9b79619d3f26608a232e96a127322b07eadf21860a382733b76ca03ca",
      "context": "Audio & Video > Interactions",
      "contextHash": "1ae63872b0f12c9e571837f1fe71fe052fbb31714472811f143e7f88d38ba5f3",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_77f06185b201b67d36c0a58e_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Loop — replay the media automatically once it ends.",
      "sourceHash": "77f06185b201b67d36c0a58ef313f45f160db59e5c5bb04811f46527a438ec3d",
      "context": "Audio & Video > Interactions",
      "contextHash": "1ae63872b0f12c9e571837f1fe71fe052fbb31714472811f143e7f88d38ba5f3",
