      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Text notes:__TRILIUM_PH_1__ in the formatting toolbar, click __TRILIUM_PH_2__Insert__TRILIUM_PH_3__ → __TRILIUM_PH_4__Include__TRILIUM_PH_5__.",
      "sourceHash": "85001b03f29908bf9d7868b318a5ea9e3eb2b7b1058a20148eff8f4b3f3444c5",
      "context": "Audio & Video > Including media in notes",
